- workerd (https://github.com/cloudflare/workerd), licensed under the Apache
  License, Version 2.0. native/sqlite/patches/sqlite/0001-row-counts.patch
  starts from workerd's patches/sqlite/0001-row-counts-plain.patch, without
  its comments and its shell hunk, and its header lists the changes that
  Sirannon made to it.
- libSQL (https://github.com/tursodatabase/libsql), Copyright 2022 the libSQL
  authors, licensed under the MIT License. workerd's row-count patch contains
  libSQL's row-counting code.
- node-gyp (https://github.com/nodejs/node-gyp), Copyright (c) 2012 Nathan
  Rajlich, licensed under the MIT License. native/sqlite/win-delay-load-hook.cc
  follows node-gyp's src/win_delay_load_hook.cc.
- better-sqlite3 (https://github.com/WiseLibs/better-sqlite3), Copyright (c)
  2017 Joshua Wise, licensed under the MIT License.
  The patches in native/sqlite/patches/better-sqlite3 change better-sqlite3's
  source.
  The lib directory of the @delali/sirannon-sqlite package contains
  better-sqlite3's JavaScript unchanged, and each
  @delali/sirannon-sqlite-<platform> package contains better-sqlite3's native
  module compiled from that changed source.
- node-addon-api (https://github.com/nodejs/node-addon-api), Copyright (c)
  2017 Node.js API collaborators, licensed under the MIT License. Each
  @delali/sirannon-sqlite-<platform> package contains code compiled from
  node-addon-api's headers.
- SQLite3 Multiple Ciphers
  (https://github.com/utelle/SQLite3MultipleCiphers), Copyright (c) 2006-2026
  Ulrich Telle, licensed under the MIT License. Each
  @delali/sirannon-sqlite-<platform> package contains SQLite3 Multiple
  Ciphers compiled from its amalgamation, with the patches in
  native/sqlite/patches/sqlite applied. That amalgamation also contains the
  code in the next three entries.
- The AEGIS library, Copyright (c) 2023-2024 Frank Denis, licensed under the
  MIT License, which SQLite3 Multiple Ciphers carries for its AEGIS cipher.
- The FIPS 180-2 SHA-224/256/384/512 implementation, Copyright (C) 2005, 2007
