- The Argon2 reference implementation, Copyright 2015 Daniel Dinu, Dmitry
  Khovratovich, Jean-Philippe Aumasson, and Samuel Neves, which its authors
  offer under CC0 1.0 or the Apache License, Version 2.0. Sirannon uses it
  under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

